{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日村さん\nお誕生日おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/15/4074962/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\nチームら 2公演目でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反省点も多くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにより、\n自分の臨機応変に対応できないところが\nかなり出ちゃったな\nと思う回だと思いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこういう事があるから\n全然1公演ずつ違う特別なものになるし\n舞台ならではの良さかなー\nと思う事にしてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに、\nあーちゃんも落語 良かったし\n本当に特別な公演だったよね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/15/4074962/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/15/4074962/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は\n握手会です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/15/4074962/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"息抜きは何をする？乃木坂とかアイドル以外で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/15/4074962/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな飲食チェーン店は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\n答えを教えて